  "subTitleDesc": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 2.0,
    "cls_id": "CB05129",
    "sub_id": "42350",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "sub_title": "國際金融市場匯兌\nInternational Financial Markets & Foreign Exchange\n國際貿易實務International Trade Practice",
    "sub_title_en": null,
    "sub_describe": "國際金融市場過去曾被經濟學家形容是「神奇」與「奧秘」的領域，然而近二十年來，由於金融國際化的發展，已經成為現代人的經濟生活中最真實接觸的領域，近兩年來，全球投資人開始投資美股、美債、黃金、ETF加密貨幣等金融商品，亦為國際金融市場中資金頻繁流動的現象，因此，商學院學生對於國際金融市場的各種商品，必須加以瞭解與熟悉。\n由於金融國際化最重要的特徵，就是貨幣資金在國際間的高度流動，因此，國際金融所探討的，正是貨幣流通和資金移動跨越國界形成的國際經濟與金融的互動，以及與此有關的活動、機構、市場、官方政策、國際協議、國際組織與制度性安排。\n自從2008年爆發美國次貸風暴並擴大成全球金融海嘯之後，國際金融體系已產生巨大變革，政府欲將台灣打造成亞太資產管理中心及金融中心的願景，代表將金融市場國際化視為台灣經濟永續發展的希冀，因此具備國際金融的基本知識，並能產生敏銳的洞察能力，將是面對新世紀所不可或缺的條件。\nInternational financial markets were once deemed \"mysterious\" by economists. However, with financial globalization over the past two decades, they have become integral to modern economic life. In recent years, global investors have increasingly engaged in U.S. stocks, bonds, gold, ETFs, and cryptocurrencies, driving frequent capital flows. Business students must thus develop a comprehensive understanding of these markets.\nFinancial globalization is characterized by high capital mobility across borders, shaping interactions between international economics and finance. This field examines monetary flows, financial institutions, markets, policies, international agreements, and regulatory frameworks.\nSince the 2008 global financial crisis, the international financial system has undergone significant tran",
    "sub_describe_en": null
  },
  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "國際貿易與匯兌",
    "sub_ename": "INTERNATIONAL TRADE AND EXCHANGE",
    "describe_ch": "分為國際貿易實務、國際匯兌理論與實務。本課程介紹國際匯兌原理、法規與方法；外匯理論與其應用；及國際外匯市場工具的實務應用。",
    "describe_eh": "This course comprises two parts: one is International Trade Practices and the other is Foreign Exchange Theory and Its Practices. It introduces international foreign exchange principles, regulations and methods; and foreign exchange markets theory and its application in practices; international foreign exchange markets instruments application.",
    "pre_subname": "ECON1001經濟學(一)、ECON1002經濟學(二)",
    "pre_sub_id3": "ECON1001",
    "pre_sub_ename": "ECON1001 ECONOMICS(1)、ECON1002 ECONOMICS(2)",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "理解國際匯兌的原理、工具、和方法",
      "describe_en": "Understanding the basic principles of foreign exchange, and its tools, and methods."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "理解外匯理論與其應用",
      "describe_en": "Comprehension of foreign exchange theory and its application."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "應用國際外匯市場操作的各種技巧",
      "describe_en": "Application of the various operating skills in international foreign exchange market."
    }
  ],
